  "description": "A struggling private investigator running a small agency accepts a lucrative offer to follow a wealthy client's younger brother. The assignment seems almost too easy, and he hopes to stretch it out for as long as possible. However, things take an unexpected turn when his target, an ordinary-looking college student, approaches him with a shocking request: \"Please kill me with your own hands.\" What began as a simple surveillance job soon becomes something far more unsettling.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/special_love)",
